R1 stays at 0x34 instead of becoming 0x1234.

**After (fix):**
```
MOV R1, #0x34        ; Load low byte
ORR R1, R1, #0x12, LSL #8  ; Correctly OR in high byte
```
R1 becomes 0x1234 as intended.

